WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.217
Receptionist (female): Good morning, Westbridge University Residence. How can I help?

00:04.637 --> 00:08.012
Student (male): Hello. I'm calling to complete my accommodation application.

00:08.532 --> 00:12.134
Receptionist (female): Certainly. First, can I take your family name?

00:12.454 --> 00:15.476
Student (male): It's Chen. C, H, E, N.

00:15.996 --> 00:18.171
Receptionist (female): Thank you. And when will you arrive?

00:18.471 --> 00:23.409
Student (male): On the fourteenth of October. I originally wrote the twelfth, but my flight changed.

00:23.829 --> 00:27.687
Receptionist (female): Right, the fourteenth of October. Do you want a shared room?

00:27.987 --> 00:31.929
Student (male): No, a single room, please. I need somewhere quiet to study.

00:32.349 --> 00:34.013
Receptionist (female): Any dietary requirement?

00:34.292 --> 00:38.592
Student (male): Yes, vegetarian. I eat dairy products, but no meat or fish.

00:39.152 --> 00:55.830
Receptionist (female): Now, several facilities are included in the weekly fee. Every room has Wi-Fi, and residents can use the bicycle storage without charge. The laundry is available, but each wash costs three pounds. Breakfast is optional, and I'm afraid there is no gym in this building.

00:56.330 --> 00:58.689
Student (male): That's fine. What documents do you need?

00:58.989 --> 01:09.600
Receptionist (female): Please send a copy of your passport by email. You can show the original at reception when you arrive. The deposit must be paid by bank transfer. We cannot accept cash for that.

01:10.020 --> 01:12.882
Student (male): I understand. What time can I collect my key?

01:13.182 --> 01:20.045
Receptionist (female): Check-in begins at three p.m. You said your flight lands at two, so arriving around half past four should be comfortable.

01:20.465 --> 01:28.294
Student (male): Great. I chose Westbridge because it is close to the science building. The city centre residence was newer, but it was much farther from my classes.

01:28.654 --> 01:32.079
Receptionist (female): That makes sense. I'll email your confirmation today.
